Listing content: facts only (bot name, creator, tools, category, source link),
with credit to each creator and source. No prompt text, descriptions, logos or
icon files are copied from the original directory. A creator's prompt appears only with
their opt-in (see consent/).

Fonts: Geist and Geist Mono by Vercel, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Display font: General Sans Medium by Indian Type Foundry (fontshare.com), ITF Free Font
License 2.0 (fonts/LICENSES/GeneralSans-ITF-FFL.txt). Self-hosted on the site only, file
unmodified. The license forbids redistributing the font through a repository, so the file
is NOT in this repo (gitignored, purged from history). `npm run fonts` (run before every
build) downloads the official file from Fontshare and checks its sha256.

Integration logos (public/logos/): either official files from the owner's brand kit, press
page or website (Grok, LinkedIn, Glean, Gmail, Slack, Axiom, Ferndesk, Infisical), or
Simple Icons (CC0) renderings of official marks (all others). Codex is shown with our own
letter tile, not OpenAI's mark. Sources, any changes and guideline
links per logo are in logos/SOURCES.md. Logos and names are trademarks of their owners, used only to identify
integrations. No endorsement by any brand owner is implied.
